  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Sector Voice and Accountability Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute towards enrolling and retaining 4 million children in quality education by providing grants through a challenge fund to enhance citizens&#x2019; voice for improved service delivery and accountability in the education system. This will be achieved by establishing models to improve children and parental voice at local levels, providing policy recommendations for education delivery at district and provincial levels and advocating for administrative/policy decisions by local authorities through project activities.</narrative>
  </description>
